{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Doop Loops cereal mascot with one goal\u2014collect as many loops as possible. The problem? You\u2019re hopelessly addicted to the stuff, and the Cereal Protection Task Force will do anything to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through colorful environments, dodge the clumsy but determined cops, and take on over\u2011the\u2011top boss fights in this fast\u2011paced arcade action game with a quirky story and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does the demo include?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three levels and a boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny and cinematic cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alleyway scene with basic cosmetics and level switching</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will the full game include?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ levels set in multiple locations and periodic boss fights with new mechanics introduced as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression: unlock cosmetics, acquire perks, and improve your stats on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op multiplayer (likely after the initial release)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963150?t=1757730606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963150/1cb4b893ce2de5c2ca1e4e4c5e1483fa3ebfef0a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757730606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963150/94173fb0243dea2d4e0797d3f499e6af05f8f102/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757730606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963150/94173fb0243dea2d4e0797d3f499e6af05f8f102/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757730606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des